<h2>Escalation Flowchart</h2>
<div style="background:var(--color-bg-alt);border-radius:6px;padding:2rem;margin:1rem 0;">
  <p style="margin:0 0 1rem;font-weight:600;">When in doubt, follow this path:</p>
  <ol style="margin-left:1.25rem;">
    <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;"><strong>Try the primary contact</strong> listed above for your issue type</li>
    <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;"><strong>Allow 24 hours</strong> for response (same-day for rush/urgent)</li>
    <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;"><strong>Escalate to your Pinnacle Sales territory rep</strong> (see team table above) if unresolved</li>
    <li style="margin-bottom:0;"><strong>We take it from here</strong> — Pinnacle Sales will coordinate with the factory, follow up, and keep you updated until resolution</li>
  </ol>
</div>

</DealerHubLayout>

<style is:global>
  .team-table { overflow-x: auto; margin: 1rem 0; }
  .team-table table {
    width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.88rem;
  }
  .team-table th {
    text-align: left; padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-dark); font-size: 0.78rem;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .team-table td {
    padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .team-table a { color: var(--color-dark); }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .team-table { font-size: 0.8rem; }
    .team-table th, .team-table td { padding: 0.4rem 0.5rem; }
  }
</style>
